msgid ""
"To avoid type name duplication errors between ``struct`` type names and "
"their ``typedef``-ed aliases when generating code documentation, the suffix "
"for all ``struct`` type names has been changed from ``_t`` to ``_s``. "
"Aliases with ``_t`` suffixes remain in place. Thus, this change is a "
"breaking change only for code that uses full ``struct`` type specifiers i.e. "
"``struct type_name_t``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Releases/Release-Humble-Hawksbill.rst:666
msgid ""
"See `ros2/rmw#313 <https://github.com/ros2/rmw/pull/313>`__ for more details."
