msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Get-Started/Releases/Release-Humble-Hawksbill.rst:674
msgid ""
"By default, Humble Hawksbill uses Connext 6.0.1 as the DDS implementation "
"for ``rmw_connextdds``. It is still possible to use Connext 5.3.1 with "
"``rmw_connextdds``, but it must be rebuilt from source."
